{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20265Ccu1bY2CZ1794612741.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國人工智能公司OpenAI，為AI代理增加付款服務，可幫使用者完成購物。</p><p></p><p>OpenAI與美國運通、萬事達卡及Visa等金融機構合作，讓公司在美國的專業版用戶，可以透過特定AI代理代為購物，代理不會取得使用者的實際信用卡資料，每筆交易必須通過安全驗證，例如透過人臉識別，或指紋辨識等安全檢查進行核准。OpenAI表明，不會在有關交易中抽取分成，但分析相信，有關服務長遠而言，或可為OpenAI帶來收入。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T00:57:08.260186+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":201,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T22:36:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T02:51:39.059467+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T00:50:23.265052+00:00","content_hash":"12b85c052e7d2eb8d4e506465495551c71c49b2af0a733b7ed594b7cc21ce3c2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}